{"id": "EUVD-2026-108652", "enisaUuid": "94b7822f-8690-393f-964c-9826282407d3", "description": "`JweDirectDecryptorBlock.Decrypt` read a 64-bit plaintext length from the `_thales_aad` protected-header field and used it without any validation. A truncated field panics `binary.BigEndian.Uint64`, an oversized value drives an unbounded allocation, and a value larger than the decrypted block panics with a slice-bounds error.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T08:54:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T08:54:37", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/eclipse-keypont/gose/security/advisories/GHSA-4gj8-hg2r-gw6q"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89319"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "51941c02-d5fe-3631-aa6a-75eb5f154c91", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0.9.0 \u22640.13.0-rc1"}, {"id": "669cefbd-5b96-3b0f-8fa7-b0671f5b977d", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.0-rc1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f36ed5cd-99b5-3d61-8843-8d4949e2a171", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}